---
interface Props {}
---

<section id="faq" class="py-20 lg:py-32 relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <!-- Aurora glow -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 aurora-bg opacity-60" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- Noise texture -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 noise opacity-[0.015]" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="section-container relative z-10">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal up stagger-1 duration-normal ease-spring">
      <span class="section-label magnetic" data-magnetic-strength="0.1">Questions Fréquentes</span>
      <h2 id="faq-title" class="section-title font-display reveal-text">
        Réponses à vos
        <br class="hidden sm:block" />
        <span class="text-gradient">questions</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle mx-auto">
        Tout ce qu'il faut savoir avant votre consultation. Besoin d'une info précise ? Contactez-nous directement.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Accordion with 3D Cards -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4 reveal up stagger-2 duration-slow ease-spring">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <div class="card-interactive overflow-hidden group hover-lift magnetic perspective-reveal" data-faq="1" data-magnetic-strength="0.1" data-lift-distance="4">
        <dt>
          <button class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 focus:ring-inset magnetic" data-magnetic-strength="0.15" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-1-content">
            <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-pearl-950 dark:text-white pr-4 font-display">Comment prendre rendez-vous ?</span>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-violet-500 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-aria-expanded:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </button>
        </dt>
        <dd id="faq-1-content" class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 text-pearl-600 dark:text-pearl-400 leading-relaxed" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-1-trigger">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <p>Vous pouvez prendre rendez-vous de 3 façons simples :</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-med-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg> <strong>Par téléphone :</strong> 07 62 36 73 37 (du lundi au samedi aux horaires d'ouverture)</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg> <strong>Par WhatsApp :</strong> Cliquez sur le bouton "Rendez-vous" pour discuter directement</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg> <strong>Via le formulaire :</strong> Remplissez le formulaire de contact, nous vous rappelons sous 24h</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="pt-2">Nous vous confirmerons le créneau et vous indiquerons les documents à apporter (carte d'identité, carte CNSS/Mutuelle, anciens comptes-rendus).</p>
          </div>
        </dd>
        <!-- Accent line -->
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 via-violet-500 to-rose-500 scale-x-0 group-aria-expanded:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500 ease-spring origin-left" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <div class="card-interactive overflow-hidden group hover-lift magnetic perspective-reveal" data-faq="2" data-magnetic-strength="0.1" data-lift-distance="4" style="animation-delay: 0.05s">
        <dt>
          <button class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 focus:ring-inset magnetic" data-magnetic-strength="0.15" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-2-content">
            <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-pearl-950 dark:text-white pr-4 font-display">La consultation est-elle remboursée ?</span>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-500 to-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-aria-expanded:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </button>
        </dt>
        <dd id="faq-2-content" class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 text-pearl-600 dark:text-pearl-400 leading-relaxed" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-2-trigger">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-4 bg-med-50 dark:bg-med-900/30 rounded-2xl border border-med-200/50 dark:border-med-800/50">
              <p class="font-semibold text-med-700 dark:text-med-300 mb-2">Dermatologie médicale :</p>
              <p>Oui, la consultation est remboursée par la CNSS et la plupart des mutuelles sur la base du tarif de convention. Apportez votre carte CNSS et votre carte de mutuelle.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/30 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200/50 dark:border-rose-800/50">
              <p class="font-semibold text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 mb-2">Médecine esthétique :</p>
              <p>Non remboursée (actes de confort). Un devis détaillé vous sera remis avant tout traitement.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-teal-50 dark:bg-teal-900/30 rounded-2xl border border-teal-200/50 dark:border-teal-800/50">
              <p class="font-semibold text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-300 mb-2">Laser médical (cicatrices, pathologies) :</p>
              <p>Peut être partiellement pris en charge selon l'indication médicale. Renseignez-vous auprès de votre mutuelle.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </dd>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 via-cyan-500 to-med-500 scale-x-0 group-aria-expanded:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500 ease-spring origin-left" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <div class="card-interactive overflow-hidden group hover-lift magnetic perspective-reveal" data-faq="3" data-magnetic-strength="0.1" data-lift-distance="4" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">
        <dt>
          <button class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 focus:ring-inset magnetic" data-magnetic-strength="0.15" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-3-content">
            <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-pearl-950 dark:text-white pr-4 font-display">Quels documents apporter à la 1ère consultation ?</span>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-500 to-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-aria-expanded:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </button>
        </dt>
        <dd id="faq-3-content" class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 text-pearl-600 dark:text-pearl-400 leading-relaxed" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-3-trigger">
          <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-med-100 dark:bg-med-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-med-600 dark:text-med-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div> Pièce d'identité (CIN ou passeport)</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-teal-100 dark:bg-teal-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div> Carte CNSS / carte de mutuelle</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div> Anciens comptes-rendus médicaux, analyses, biopsies</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div> Liste de vos traitements en cours</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-cyan-100 dark:bg-cyan-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div> Photos de l'évolution de votre problème (si applicable)</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div> Votre routine cosmétique actuelle (produits utilisés)</li>
          </ul>
        </dd>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-500 via-rose-600 to-amber-500 scale-x-0 group-aria-expanded:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500 ease-spring origin-left" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <div class="card-interactive overflow-hidden group hover-lift magnetic perspective-reveal" data-faq="4" data-magnetic-strength="0.1" data-lift-distance="4" style="animation-delay: 0.15s">
        <dt>
          <button class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 focus:ring-inset magnetic" data-magnetic-strength="0.15" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-4-content">
            <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-pearl-950 dark:text-white pr-4 font-display">Les traitements laser sont-ils douloureux ?</span>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-orange-500 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-aria-expanded:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </button>
        </dt>
        <dd id="faq-4-content" class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 text-pearl-600 dark:text-pearl-400 leading-relaxed" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-4-trigger">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <p>La plupart des traitements laser sont bien tolérés. La sensation varie selon le type de laser et la zone traitée :</p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div><div><strong>Épilation laser :</strong> Sensation d'élastique qui claque, atténuée par le système de refroidissement intégré</div></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div><div><strong>Laser vasculaire/pigmentaire :</strong> Légère chaleur, supportable sans anesthésie</div></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div><div><strong>Laser fractionné CO2 :</strong> Crème anesthésiante appliquée 45 min avant la séance</div></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="pt-2">Nous adaptons toujours la puissance à votre confort. Dites-le si c'est trop intense !</p>
          </div>
        </dd>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-orange-500 to-red-500 scale-x-0 group-aria-expanded:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500 ease-spring origin-left" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <div class="card-interactive overflow-hidden group hover-lift magnetic perspective-reveal" data-faq="5" data-magnetic-strength="0.1" data-lift-distance="4" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">
        <dt>
          <button class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 focus:ring-inset magnetic" data-magnetic-strength="0.15" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-5-content">
            <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-pearl-950 dark:text-white pr-4 font-display">Combien de séances pour l'épilation laser ?</span>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-teal-500 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-aria-expanded:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </button>
        </dt>
        <dd id="faq-5-content" class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 text-pearl-600 dark:text-pearl-400 leading-relaxed" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-5-trigger">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <p class="text-center py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500/10 to-teal-500/10 rounded-2xl border border-cyan-200/50 dark:border-cyan-800/50">
              <span class="text-3xl font-bold font-mono text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">6 à 8</span> séances en moyenne
            </p>
            <p>Espacées de 4 à 8 semaines selon la zone et votre pilosité.</p>
            <div class="p-4 bg-pearl-50 dark:bg-pearl-900/50 rounded-2xl border border-pearl-200/50 dark:border-pearl-700/50">
              <p class="font-semibold text-pearl-950 dark:text-white mb-2">Facteurs influençant le nombre :</p>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-sm">
                <li>Couleur de peau</li>
                <li>Épaisseur du poil</li>
                <li>Zone hormonale (visage)</li>
                <li>Régularité des séances</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <p class="pt-2">Un entretien annuel (1-2 séances) peut être nécessaire pour maintenir le résultat. La première consultation permet d'établir un protocole personnalisé et un devis.</p>
          </div>
        </dd>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 via-teal-500 to-med-500 scale-x-0 group-aria-expanded:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500 ease-spring origin-left" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 6 -->
      <div class="card-interactive overflow-hidden group hover-lift magnetic perspective-reveal" data-faq="6" data-magnetic-strength="0.1" data-lift-distance="4" style="animation-delay: 0.25s">
        <dt>
          <button class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 focus:ring-inset magnetic" data-magnetic-strength="0.15" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-6-content">
            <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-pearl-950 dark:text-white pr-4 font-display">Y a-t-il des effets secondaires aux injections ?</span>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500 to-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-aria-expanded:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </button>
        </dt>
        <dd id="faq-6-content" class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 text-pearl-600 dark:text-pearl-400 leading-relaxed" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-6-trigger">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <p>Les effets secondaires sont généralement <strong>légers et transitoires</strong> :</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div> Petits bleus ou rougeurs aux points d'injection (disparaissent en quelques jours)</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div> Léger gonflement (quelques heures à 48h)</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-teal-100 dark:bg-teal-900/50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></div> Sensation de tension temporaire</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="p-4 bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-900/30 rounded-2xl border border-violet-200/50 dark:border-violet-800/50 pt-2">
              <p class="text-sm"><strong>Complications rares</strong> (infection, asymétrie, nécrose) : <strong>quasi nulles</strong> entre les mains d'un dermatologue expérimenté respectant les règles d'asepsie et d'anatomie. Nous utilisons uniquement des produits certifiés (Allergan, Galderma, Merz, Teoxane...).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </dd>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-500 via-purple-500 to-rose-500 scale-x-0 group-aria-expanded:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500 ease-spring origin-left" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 7 -->
      <div class="card-interactive overflow-hidden group hover-lift magnetic perspective-reveal" data-faq="7" data-magnetic-strength="0.1" data-lift-distance="4" style="animation-delay: 0.3s">
        <dt>
          <button class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 focus:ring-inset magnetic" data-magnetic-strength="0.15" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-7-content">
